add(table(["Error class", "Cards", "Field"], B3.classes.map((c) => [c[0], String(c[1]), c[2]]), [4.4, 0.7, 0.9], "Table 2d. Every error on the 300-card test set, by cause. A card with errors in two classes is counted in both."));
add(P_("The test set tells a different story from the development page, and a more useful one. Jewar is read almost without error (" + B3.byAc[63][0] + " of 90 cards), Dadri well (" + B3.byAc[62][0] + " of 90), Noida poorly (" + B3.byAc[61][0] + " of 120), and the Noida errors are systematic: " + B3.classes[0][1] + " of its 120 EPIC numbers were read with the wrong series prefix, ZYH as YHO or YHS, all three reads agreeing because they share the crop, and " + B3.classes[1][1] + " house numbers of the form B-nnn were read as 8-nnn. Both are in the Latin font the roll uses for numbers; the first letter is dropped and a following 0 is read as O. The synthetic page reproduces both faults (" + SYN.note + "), which places them in the crop and whitelist of the two passes, not in the scans. Roll-wide, " + n(PFX[61].YHO + PFX[61].YHS) + " of Noida's " + n(PFX[61].total) + " current-format numbers (" + pct(PFX[61].YHO + PFX[61].YHS, PFX[61].total) + ") begin YHO or YHS, prefixes the Commission has not issued, and " + pct(PFX[62].NOT, PFX[62].total) + " of Dadri's begin NOT for NDT. The test-set rate for Noida (12.5%) is higher than the roll-wide one because the fault is confined to numbers whose digits begin with 0" + (EZ ? ": of Noida's ZYH0 numbers, " + n(EZ.YHO0) + " were read as YHO0 against " + n(EZ.ZYH0) + " read correctly" : "") + ", an older issue range in which two of the four sampled pages happened to lie. These are plausible-but-wrong EPICs, and no format check sees them. The remaining errors are " + B3.classes[4][1] + " single-glyph name errors of the kind consensus addresses, three cards whose relation is printed as अन्य, a label the parser does not know, and four house numbers in which a 3 was read as Devanagari उ. None of the fixes has been applied to the figures in this paper, which describe the rolls as read: the fix needs a re-read of 1.2 million cards, and reporting the fault with its measured scope seemed better than delaying the audit, whose rates do not depend on these fields (Section 7.5)."));
